WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.410
Guimbi Ouattara. Ɗuum ko haala taariika, ɗum laaɓɓi ngam hollaago.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.240
Ɓaawo karnijum 19th Sya, biyeteeɗo Bobo-Dioulasso hannde.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.682
Debbo gooto ɓuri worɓe ɗuuɗɓe: Guimbi Ouattara.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.600
"Onon yimɓe ɓe'e keɓan ko'e maɓɓe nder lesdi.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.800
Eɗen njahi to maako ngam ɓe cuɓɓa haala maɓɓe, nden kam en keewi mo.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.376
Nder nyalnde go'o, tawtoreejo Orop wari to Sya.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.312
O hokki mo ndiyam e cola, ngam o jaɓii boowo.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.624
Maami, miɗo yetta on ngam jaɓɓorgo mon.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.400
Haa ɗo, aadiyankeejo ɗon haaje bee am.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.276
Mi winnda ko mi yi'i.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:48.474
Ammaa halleende ɗon ɓadito. Laamiiɗo Sikasso bi'eteeɗo Tieba yiɗi ɓeydaago laamu maako.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.154
Bobo hokkata hoore mum. Wurtina mo habaruuji am.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.248
Mawɗo wootere ɗon yahda to galop.

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.932
Tieba e yiɗi a ɗowtana mo.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.488
Guimbi ummii.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.188
Yeccu joomiraawo ma, Bobo ɗon moƴƴaay.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:37.778
Ɗuum e nder suudu. Gooto fuu anndi ko jaɓugo ɗum firti.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:59.418
Sooreeɓe koyɗeeji ngari yeeso gariiri. Wurooɓe ɗon cembiɗina dow mahol.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.578
Fooje ɗon wara. Hakkiilo'en ɗon timmina.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.248
Ko ɗum waɗi, sooji'en ɓe ɗon hoola.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:43.320
Bobo wurtinaama, nden gariiri boo teddini Guimbi.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.966
Guimbi ! O ɗon haɓɓa bee laamiiɗo.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:19.600
To Bobo-Dioulasso, yimɓe ɗon nji'a innde maako haa jooni.
